## User Decisions ✅ APPROVED

> [!NOTE]
> **Grading Scale Strategy - DECIDED**
> - **Selected**: Option B - Store grades in the user's preferred scale
> - When language is **Farsi**: Store and display grades on 0-20 scale
> - When language is **English**: Store and display grades on 0-100 scale
> - Grade conversion will occur at language switch time (with user confirmation)

> [!NOTE]
> **Font Selection - DECIDED**
> - **Selected**: Vazirmatn font family with multiple variations
> - Use different weights strategically:
>   - **Thin (100)**: Subtle labels, metadata
>   - **Regular (400)**: Body text, descriptions
>   - **Medium (500)**: Navigation, buttons
>   - **SemiBold (600)**: Section headers
>   - **Bold (700)**: Page titles, emphasis
> - This creates beautiful, eye-readable, modern typography

