## Proposed Changes

### Infrastructure Layer (New Files)

---

#### [NEW] [mod.rs](file:///home/parsa/secure_projects/Edu/EduTalent/packages/web/src/i18n/mod.rs)

Core i18n module exposing:
- `Locale` enum with `En` and `Fa` variants (default: `Fa`)
- `LocaleProvider` context component
- `use_locale()` hook for components
- `t!()` macro for translation lookup
- `TranslationKey` type for compile-time key checking

```rust
// Core structure
pub enum Locale {
    En,  // English
    Fa,  // Farsi (Persian) - Default
}

impl Default for Locale {
    fn default() -> Self {
        Locale::Fa  // Farsi as default
    }
}
```

---

#### [NEW] [translations.rs](file:///home/parsa/secure_projects/Edu/EduTalent/packages/web/src/i18n/translations.rs)

Translation loading and lookup logic:
- Load JSON translation files
- Fallback chain (requested → default → key itself)
- Namespace support for organizing translations

---

#### [NEW] [grading.rs](file:///home/parsa/secure_projects/Edu/EduTalent/packages/web/src/i18n/grading.rs)

Locale-aware grading utilities:
- `GradingScale` trait with `scale_100()` and `scale_20()` implementations
- Grade conversion functions: `to_display(grade: f64, locale: Locale) -> String`
- Grade input parsing with locale awareness

```rust
pub fn convert_grade_for_display(grade_100: f64, locale: Locale) -> String {
    match locale {
        Locale::En => format!("{:.0}%", grade_100),
        Locale::Fa => format!("{:.1}", grade_100 * 20.0 / 100.0), // Convert to 20-scale
    }
}
```

