#### [MODIFY] All 67 view files in role_based directories

Each file requires:
1. Import i18n utilities: `use crate::i18n::{t, use_locale};`
2. Replace all string literals with `t!()` calls
3. Update any grade displays to use locale-aware formatting

Estimated changes per file: 10-50 strings depending on UI complexity.

---

#### [MODIFY] [main.css](file:///home/parsa/secure_projects/Edu/EduTalent/packages/web/assets/main.css)

Add RTL support:
```css
/* RTL base styles */
[dir="rtl"] {
  --text-align: right;
  --flex-direction: row-reverse;
}

/* Convert all margin/padding to logical properties */
.glass-card {
  margin-inline-start: var(--spacing-4);
  padding-inline-end: var(--spacing-2);
}

/* Icon direction flip for RTL */
[dir="rtl"] .material-icons-outlined.chevron_right {
  transform: scaleX(-1);
}

/* Farsi font import */
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Vazirmatn:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

[lang="fa"] {
  font-family: 'Vazirmatn', 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, sans-serif;
}
```

