## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests

```bash
# Run i18n-specific unit tests
cargo test --package web --features server -- i18n

# Verify no untranslated strings (build script check)
cargo build --package web --features check-translations

# Run E2E tests with Farsi locale
LOCALE=fa dx test
```

### Browser Testing (Subagent Tasks)

1. **Language Switching Flow**
   - Navigate to login page
   - Verify Farsi is default (RTL layout, Persian text)
   - Switch to English
   - Verify LTR layout and English text
   - Refresh and verify persistence

2. **Grading Display Verification**
   - Login as student
   - Navigate to grades page
   - In Farsi mode: verify grades show as X/20 format
   - In English mode: verify grades show as X% format

3. **RTL Layout Integrity**
   - Navigate all major pages in Farsi mode
   - Verify no layout breaks
   - Check sidebar, navigation, forms, modals

### Manual Verification

- [ ] Full translation review by native Farsi speaker
- [ ] Typography review (font rendering, numerals)
- [ ] Verify all dates/times format correctly per locale

