## Risk Mitigation

| Risk                    | Probability | Impact | Mitigation                    |
| ----------------------- | ----------- | ------ | ----------------------------- |
| Missing translations    | Medium      | High   | Build-time check for coverage |
| RTL layout breaks       | Medium      | Medium | Comprehensive visual testing  |
| Grading scale confusion | Low         | High   | Clear UI labels for scale     |
| Performance degradation | Low         | Low    | Efficient JSON caching        |
